{"id":"msg_m_ex_external_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_external","label":"Extrinsic · Group"},"label":"4. Commander,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_external_03","next":"msg_m_ex_external_05","speakers":{"maiden":"Maiden","guillotine":"Guillotine"},"icons":{"maiden":"si_c181_00_s","guillotine":"si_c180_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_external_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_1","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_2","text":"Extrinsic is going to be disbanded as of today.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_3","text":"Did Guillotine do something?","jump":"m_ex_external_04_7"},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_4","text":"Is this a practical joke?","jump":"m_ex_external_04_5"},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_5","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_6","text":"Then Guillotine must have done something.","jump":"m_ex_external_04_7"},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_7","text":"Red Rose,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_8","text":"did you become enchanted by the darkness?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_9","text":"How can you renege on a blood pact?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_10","text":"It would seem you are not afraid of","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_11","text":"the impending reprisal of the Dark Lord.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_12","text":"I feel like I know the reason why you're disbanding the squad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_13","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_14","text":"I can't take it anymore.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_15","text":"What was the inciting incident?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_16","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_17","text":"After completing an operation recently,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_18","text":"I was going to do something I hadn't done in a while;","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_19","text":"have dinner with Guillotine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_20","text":"Why is that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_21","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_22","text":"Er...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_23","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_24","text":"Is it not easy to say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_25","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_26","text":"She allowed me to borrow some of Extrinsic's funds","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_27","text":"to buy a limited-edition costume.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_28","text":"I was quite grateful to her for that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_29","text":"so I said I would treat her to dinner.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_30","text":"As you should.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_31","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_32","text":"I went to that restaurant with good intentions,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_33","text":"and we arrived in high spirits.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_34","text":"However...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_35","text":"Haha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_36","text":"The material things predetermined by the world","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_37","text":"are of no use to the One-Winged Dark Lord.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_38","text":"It's all because of her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_39","text":"She ruined everything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_40","text":"She kept demanding a salad with helmet flowers","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_41","text":"that wasn't even on the menu.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_42","text":"Aren't those poisonous?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_43","text":"Exactly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_44","text":"Once our food was served,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_45","text":"she guffawed","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_46","text":"and said that she could hear the groans of untold sacrifices in the air.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_47","text":"Hahahah!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_48","text":"Even the memory of that moment","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_49","text":"is enough to make the One-Winged Dark Lord strain at its chains and be on the brink of another rampage.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_50","text":":'(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_51","text":"All the other people dining there","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_52","text":"started staring and whispering about us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_53","text":"Even the employees avoided coming to our table.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_54","text":"It must have been quite embarrassing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_55","text":"Extremely.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_56","text":"They eventually","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_57","text":"asked us to leave","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_58","text":"because we were disturbing the other diners.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_59","text":"Oh my goodness.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_60","text":"Hmph.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_61","text":"It seems that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_62","text":"the Guardian of Balance","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_63","text":"does not resonate with ordinary people.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_64","text":"Indeed, those who harbor the One-Winged Dark Lord within them","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_65","text":"are forsaken to a lonely fate wherever they may travel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_66","text":"At this rate,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_67","text":"it's getting almost impossible to keep the team running.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_68","text":"When even something as simple as dining out becomes an ordeal,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_69","text":"I think it's best we just go our separate ways.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_70","text":"Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_71","text":"You dare try to bow out of a pact","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_72","text":"with Guillotine de Mephisto","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_73","text":"for such minute reasons?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_74","text":"Purification is indeed necessary.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_75","text":"Next time, just order something that's on the menu.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_76","text":"Partner,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_77","text":"are you trying to confine the One-Winged Dark Lord","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_78","text":"within the regulations dictated by this world?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_79","text":"How foolish you are.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_80","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_80","text":"If you keep it up, Maiden is going to leave you.","jump":"m_ex_external_04_82"},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_81","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_81","text":"If you keep it up, I'm going to report you to Ingrid.","jump":"m_ex_external_04_82"},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_82","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_83","text":"Surely you jest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_84","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_84","text":"I'm not joking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_85","text":"Very well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_86","text":"You leave me no choice.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_87","text":"Perhaps this is also destiny.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_88","text":"Sometimes, lowering oneself into the dregs","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_89","text":"with such foolish individuals","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_90","text":"is part of the solitary fate of those who harbor the One-Winged Dark Lord.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_91","text":"This is one fight I must abandon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_92","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_92","text":"I think we've managed to resolve everything, Maiden.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_93","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_94","text":"I guess it'll be fine for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_external_04_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"maiden","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_external_04_95","text":"Thanks, Commander.","jump":null}],"chat":true}